If you bleed, you have to react well.

73
00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.426
To do that, you have to study a lot.

74
00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:09.834
So for the next month

75
00:04:09.901 --> 00:04:12.033
I'm going to study two days a week.

76
00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.920
(together) Ah, professor

77
00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:16.056
(Jeongmin) The response is better than expected?
So shall we do it three times?

78
00:04:17.758 --> 00:04:20.860
This week, when PPH occurs

79
00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:23.597
about what we can do
I'm going to study

80
