84
00:04:34.908 --> 00:04:35.801
Not this

85
00:04:38.979 --> 00:04:40.480
- Look at this.
- (Residing in Japan) Yes

86
00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:45.118
(Jeongmin) Now, from today

87
00:04:45.185 --> 00:04:46.953
I'm going to do something very important

88
00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.823
Practical to learn with your body, not your head

89
00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.859
So, starting today, either doze off or sleep.

90
00:04:52.926 --> 00:04:54.261
[Growling sound effect]
[Squeaking sound]

91
00:04:54.895 --> 00:04:56.596
