92
00:04:58.033 --> 00:04:59.332
(Lee Young) Yes
[Lee Young clears his throat]

93
00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:03.770
firstly

94
00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:06.873
(Jeongmin) The most important thing in PPH is

95
