If I don't do that, I'll get scolded...

162
00:07:39.568 --> 00:07:40.561
(Jeongmin) Did you do well?

163
00:07:41.329 --> 00:07:42.462
What's going on?

164
00:07:42.529 --> 00:07:43.496
What's going on?

165
00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.896
