171
00:08:12.267 --> 00:08:13.860
You don't have many mothers.

172
00:08:14.995 --> 00:08:15.867
I can do it on Thursday.

173
00:08:15.934 --> 00:08:17.764
Um, I have a conference next Thursday.

174
00:08:17.831 --> 00:08:18.932
you do it on thursday

175
