I definitely said no, huh?

193
00:09:03.901 --> 00:09:07.881
Yeah, for no reason we end up dying in the middle.
What is this, really?

194
00:09:11.067 --> 00:09:12.267
hello, hello

195
00:09:12.334 --> 00:09:13.453
