200
00:09:19.826 --> 00:09:21.528
When I'm done, I have to leave work.

201
00:09:21.595 --> 00:09:22.867
Oh, why are you looking at obstetric surgery?

202
00:09:22.934 --> 00:09:24.965
(Sabi) It’s an incarnation case.
How do I get home?

203
00:09:25.032 --> 00:09:26.734
How do I get home, I need to get home quickly

204
00:09:26.801 --> 00:09:28.001
(Sabi) That’s a really rare case.

205
00:09:28.068 --> 00:09:29.803
If it's not now, I might never see it again

206
00:09:30.434 --> 00:09:31.337
[Lee Young sighs]

207
00:09:32.734 --> 00:09:33.773
