219
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.600
In the eyes of medical residents

220
00:10:06.667 --> 00:10:09.333
These hand movements are also very amazing, uh

221
00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.777
(Sabi) I think you’re really amazing.

222
00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:12.779
[Junmo’s light smile]

223
00:10:14.251 --> 00:10:15.515
