225
00:10:17.801 --> 00:10:19.434
The operating room has changed, it's here

226
00:10:19.501 --> 00:10:20.686
(Sabi) Isn’t it?

227
00:10:20.753 --> 00:10:22.555
This is Professor Lim Dong-ju’s section number 6.

228
00:10:23.656 --> 00:10:25.001
[light music]
[Junmo’s laughter]

229
00:10:25.068 --> 00:10:25.992
(Junmo) Hey

230
00:10:26.059 --> 00:10:28.027
You, it's your turn with your wife now.

231
00:10:28.094 --> 00:10:30.997
(Sabi) Yes, but incarnation
