238
00:10:48.815 --> 00:10:50.233
[rattling sound]

239
00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:51.489
Hey!

240
00:10:52.653 --> 00:10:54.821
It hasn't even been set up yet
Why are you telling me to come down!

241
00:10:55.868 --> 00:10:56.990
(Residence in Japan) Ah

242
00:10:57.591 --> 00:10:59.392
Should I have gone to see the surgery too?

243
00:10:59.459 --> 00:11:00.834
