244
00:11:00.901 --> 00:11:03.496
(Jae-il) Are promises important now?
It's a very rare case?

245
00:11:04.128 --> 00:11:07.033
Incarcer... round?

246
00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.000
(Lee Young) Surrction

247
00:11:08.067 --> 00:11:09.402
(Jaeil) Uh, yeah, that

248
00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.304
(Lee Young) Is it true that you want to see the surgery?

249
00:11:11.371 --> 00:11:12.939
(Nanjing) Write, that is.

250
00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:14.441
You're not having surgery.

