1515
01:05:09.235 --> 01:05:12.268
CBC 6.2, uh, PLT 90,000

1516
01:05:12.335 --> 01:05:13.867
OTPT is normal

1517
01:05:13.934 --> 01:05:15.635
PT and aPTT

1518
01:05:15.702 --> 01:05:18.034
It is said to show signs of prolongation.

1519
01:05:18.101 --> 01:05:19.734
Ah, the other DIC lab

1520
01:05:19.801 --> 01:05:21.121
They say testing is in progress.

1521
01:05:21.188 --> 01:05:23.019
(Jeongmin) Well done, very good

1522
01:05:23.657 --> 01:05:25.091
Pyo Nam-kyung: Scrub first.

1523
01:05:25.158 --> 01:05:26.823
[Namkyung’s crying]

1524
01:05:27.601 --> 01:05:28.834
(Namkyung) I can’t do it...

1525
01:05:28.901 --> 01:05:30.664
[Jeongmin sighs]
(Jeongmin) Then Lee Young, you

1526
01:05:30.731 --> 01:05:33.101
[Lee Young’s heavy breathing]

1527
01:05:33.168 --> 01:05:34.964
How are you guys, don't lose your mind!

1528
01:05:35.435 --> 01:05:36.268
Mother now...

1529
01:05:36.335 --> 01:05:37.334
(Kiseon) You guys come out

1530
01:05:37.938 --> 01:05:38.834
(Jeongmin) What about surgery?

1531
01:05:38.901 --> 01:05:39.973
(Kisen) It’s over.

1532
01:05:40.040 --> 01:05:42.676
(Namkyung) Professor, I’m giving birth.

1533
01:05:42.743 --> 01:05:44.874
(Kisun) I know, you’re watching it now.

1534
01:05:52.335 --> 01:05:54.321
(Jeongmin) Hey, there is no weather today.

1535
01:05:54.388 --> 01:05:55.535
(Kisun) I guess so?

1536
01:05:55.602 --> 01:05:57.724
The only ones I can trust are our teachers

1537
01:05:57.791 --> 01:05:59.255
[ECG alarm sound]

1538
01:05:59.826 --> 01:06:01.001
(Anesthesiology resident) Blood pressure drops

1539
01:06:01.068 --> 01:06:02.335
It's 40 out of 70.

1540
01:06:02.402 --> 01:06:03.668
(Sanghyun) I’ll keep up with the volume

1541
01:06:03.735 --> 01:06:05.061
Don't worry, get started

1542
01:06:07.668 --> 01:06:09.503
(Jeongmin) Yes, let’s begin.

1543
01:06:11.669 --> 01:06:13.770
[Lee Young’s trembling breathing]

1544
01:06:23.646 --> 01:06:25.646
[ECG meter beeping sound]
[Medical device operation sound]

1545
01:06:30.268 --> 01:06:31.254
(Steamboat) Kelly

1546
01:06:32.059 --> 01:06:34.059
[Calm music]

1547
01:06:34.834 --> 01:06:36.393
- One more Kelly
- (Yunjeong) Yes

1548
01:06:38.498 --> 01:06:39.596
(Steamboat) Metgem

1549
01:06:40.734 --> 01:06:42.132
Sucheo Tai Won-o Preparation

1550
01:06:48.519 --> 01:06:49.503
(Jeongmin) Thai

1551
01:06:56.134 --> 01:06:57.147
(steamer) cut

1552
01:07:01.435 --> 01:07:02.901
(Jeongmin) Please give me tranexamic acid.

1553
01:07:02.968 --> 01:07:04.167
(Sanghyun) Yes, I understand.

1554
01:07:16.270 --> 01:07:17.300
(Jeongmin) Tonsil

1555
01:07:20.977 --> 01:07:22.105
Right angle

1556
01:07:27.981 --> 01:07:28.982
Grab the suction

1557
01:07:29.049 --> 01:07:30.113
- (Lee Young) Yes
- (Nanjing) Yes

1558
01:07:51.471 --> 01:07:52.435
[Dowon sighs in relief]

1559
01:07:54.875 --> 01:07:58.374
(Jeongmin) He underwent liver transplant surgery.
I was worried that the adhesion would be severe, but it was easy.

1560
01:07:58.868 --> 01:08:00.810
(Kisun) So, I’m glad.

1561
01:08:04.101 --> 01:08:05.081
(Jeongmin) What do you think?

1562
01:08:07.287 --> 01:08:08.588
(Lee Young) I don’t bleed

1563
01:08:08.655 --> 01:08:09.586
(Steamboat) And?

1564
01:08:11.201 --> 01:08:12.188
(Lee Young) Mother...

1565
01:08:14.928 --> 01:08:16.059
lived

1566
01:08:16.563 --> 01:08:17.660
(Nanjing) Mother’s Day

1567
01:08:18.932 --> 01:08:20.463
I can meet the baby

1568
01:08:21.801 --> 01:08:22.932
(Jeongmin) Not like that!

1569
01:08:23.502 --> 01:08:25.335
Blood loss is 4,000cc.

1570
01:08:25.402 --> 01:08:27.337
Maternal vitals are stable.

1571
01:08:28.001 --> 01:08:29.201
(Lee Young) Ah!

1572
01:08:29.268 --> 01:08:31.468
Yes, that's right, it's normal.

1573
01:08:31.535 --> 01:08:34.244
(Nankyung) The surgery went really well.

1574
01:08:35.602 --> 01:08:36.434
[Nankyung’s embarrassed laughter]

1575
01:08:36.501 --> 01:08:38.084
[Calm music]

1576
01:08:38.151 --> 01:08:39.182
[Kiseon snorts]

1577
01:08:59.201 --> 01:09:00.201
(Jeongmin) Hey

1578
01:09:00.268 --> 01:09:01.108
(Kisun) Why?

1579
01:09:01.175 --> 01:09:02.767
Write down the surgery report

1580
01:09:02.834 --> 01:09:05.034
Why do I use it, I have kids.

1581
01:09:05.101 --> 01:09:07.435
What will they remember?

1582
01:09:07.502 --> 01:09:10.134
I barely caught the runaway soul.

1583
01:09:10.201 --> 01:09:13.335
Ah, then you write it
You came first

1584
01:09:13.402 --> 01:09:15.218
It was originally written by Eosi!

1585
01:09:15.852 --> 01:09:17.186
I was a surgeon

1586
01:09:17.799 --> 01:09:20.823
I'm so shocked that I'm out of my mind

1587
01:09:20.890 --> 01:09:23.393
(Jeongmin) Hey, how many years has it been?
Are you still surprised?

1588
01:09:24.635 --> 01:09:26.028
Have you seen postpartum hemorrhage once or twice?

1589
01:09:26.095 --> 01:09:27.468
(Kiseon) He is

1590
01:09:27.535 --> 01:09:30.602
Hey, I knew it when I saw your hands earlier.

1591
01:09:30.669 --> 01:09:33.469
Ah, that's what a trembling aspen tree is like.

1592
01:09:35.876 --> 01:09:38.111
How can you do that with your hands shaking?
Do you act perfectly?

1593
01:09:38.178 --> 01:09:40.213
[Sound of door opening]
(Kiseon) I like it perfectly, ugh.

1594
01:09:40.280 --> 01:09:41.344
[Sound of door closing]
(Jaehwi) Guys

1595
01:09:42.900 --> 01:09:44.468
Stop it now
[cute music]

1596
01:09:44.535 --> 01:09:45.267
Huh?

1597
01:09:45.334 --> 01:09:46.702
just thank you

1598
01:09:46.769 --> 01:09:48.602
Ah, good job

1599
01:09:48.669 --> 01:09:50.323
Hey, if you did a good job, that's fine.

1600
01:09:50.390 --> 01:09:55.235
20 years of losing, frying, and fighting, ugh.

1601
01:09:55.302 --> 01:09:56.659
Ooh, ooh, I'm so sick of it

1602
01:09:57.497 --> 01:09:59.095
Wow, I'm bored, you guys.

1603
01:09:59.900 --> 01:10:01.364
Wow
[Sound of door closing]

1604
01:10:02.236 --> 01:10:03.466
(Kiseon) AC

1605
01:10:08.001 --> 01:10:10.101
Good job, good job, thank you, okay?

1606
01:10:10.168 --> 01:10:11.907
(Kiseon) Heh, you’re laughing.

1607
01:10:11.974 --> 01:10:13.814
Oh, I'm bored.

1608
01:10:13.881 --> 01:10:14.944
[Jeongmin’s tired exclamation]

1609
01:10:15.568 --> 01:10:17.017
(Jaehwi) Oh, those things

1610
01:10:17.084 --> 01:10:18.014
(Sabi) Professor

1611
01:10:19.101 --> 01:10:20.668
(Jaehwi) How did they say the surgery was over?

1612
01:10:20.735 --> 01:10:22.022
(Sabi) Yes?

1613
01:10:22.089 --> 01:10:23.867
(Jaehwi) Obstetric emergency surgery

1614
01:10:23.934 --> 01:10:25.702
Oh, it ended well.

1615
01:10:25.769 --> 01:10:26.889
(Sabi) Ah

1616
01:10:31.205 --> 01:10:32.168
(Jaehwi) What, where are you going?

1617
01:10:32.235 --> 01:10:33.209
Aren't you going?

1618
01:10:35.102 --> 01:10:37.333
(Sabi) Professor, I’m going to surgery.

1619
01:10:38.268 --> 01:10:40.603
It's a laparoscopic surgery.
I need to grab the manipulator.

1620
01:10:41.402 --> 01:10:42.238
(Jaehwi) Uh...

1621
01:10:42.305 --> 01:10:44.568
I will go there
I meant to put it in first, right?

1622
01:10:44.635 --> 01:10:46.275
Because Mr. Fellow is late?

1623
01:10:46.801 --> 01:10:48.101
(Sabi) I’m going to do that.

1624
01:10:48.168 --> 01:10:49.812
I also told the fellow teacher.

1625
01:10:52.669 --> 01:10:54.834
(Jaehwi) No, it’s okay, get off work.

1626
01:10:54.901 --> 01:10:56.119
There was a lot of work today

1627
01:10:57.135 --> 01:10:58.368
Ah...

1628
01:10:58.435 --> 01:10:59.668
Oh, it's okay, go

1629
01:10:59.735 --> 01:11:01.658
It's okay, it's okay, I can do it on my own anyway.

1630
01:11:02.769 --> 01:11:04.027
(Sabi) Uh...

1631
01:11:06.700 --> 01:11:08.529
(Jaehwi) Oh, I’m really fine.
[lively music]

1632
01:11:12.168 --> 01:11:13.501
(Sabi) I’m fine too.

1633
01:11:13.568 --> 01:11:15.089
Professor, I want to see your surgery.

1634
01:11:17.344 --> 01:11:18.708
(Jaehwi) Oh, oh, really?

1635
01:11:18.775 --> 01:11:19.700
Oh, really?

1636
01:11:19.767 --> 01:11:22.068
So how about I give you some RSO?

1637
01:11:22.135 --> 01:11:23.068
(Sabi) Good!

1638
01:11:23.135 --> 01:11:24.767
- thank you!
- (Jaehwi) Uh, uh, okay?

1639
01:11:24.834 --> 01:11:26.934
Uh, then we...

1640
01:11:27.001 --> 01:11:28.718
(Dowon) Yes, professor.
Maternity stable

1641
01:11:30.086 --> 01:11:32.066
The mother's condition was also reported to the doctor helicopter team.

1642
01:11:32.133 --> 01:11:33.589
I also said thank you

1643
01:11:35.702 --> 01:11:37.560
Yes, I will keep an eye on it.

1644
01:11:39.068 --> 01:11:39.962
yes

1645
01:11:41.101 --> 01:11:42.065
[Call end tone]

1646
01:11:50.577 --> 01:11:52.008
[Keyboard operation sound]

1647
01:11:53.834 --> 01:11:54.777
Are you done?

1648
01:11:55.649 --> 01:11:57.267
(Lee Young) Oh, just give me some time
Can you give me more?

1649
01:11:57.334 --> 01:11:59.248
(Namkyung) Ah, teacher
It's not that we didn't do it.

1650
01:11:59.315 --> 01:12:00.368
I couldn't do it

1651
01:12:00.435 --> 01:12:01.818
- Today...
- I know.

1652
01:12:04.435 --> 01:12:06.668
The mother asked me to say thank you?

1653
01:12:06.735 --> 01:12:09.101
With the teacher who spoke to me as soon as I got off the helicopter

1654
01:12:09.168 --> 01:12:11.060
The teacher who asked me to go to my second birthday party

1655
01:12:11.769 --> 01:12:12.729
That's you, right?

1656
01:12:15.669 --> 01:12:16.833
Today

1657
01:12:17.437 --> 01:12:18.804
You did really well

1658
01:12:19.468 --> 01:12:22.271
It must have been very scary, difficult, and crazy.

1659
01:12:25.035 --> 01:12:28.311
It means you did a good job or something.

1660
01:12:32.568 --> 01:12:33.767
I'll do the rest

1661
01:12:33.834 --> 01:12:34.717
(Namkyung) Yes?

1662
01:12:39.268 --> 01:12:40.167
Why don't you like it? Do it then

1663
01:12:40.234 --> 01:12:41.758
No, that's not it

1664
01:12:44.594 --> 01:12:46.395
Hey, go for three counts before I change my mind

1665
01:12:48.802 --> 01:12:49.767
one

1666
01:12:50.637 --> 01:12:51.801
[Nankyung’s urgent groan]
[laughter]

1667
01:12:51.868 --> 01:12:52.934
(Nanjing) I’ll go first.

1668
01:12:53.001 --> 01:12:53.933
(Lee Young) Thank you!

1669
01:12:54.000 --> 01:12:55.938
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1670
01:13:00.635 --> 01:13:01.644
[Message incoming sound]

1671
01:13:02.879 --> 01:13:04.384
(Lee Young) See you there in 2 hours

1672
01:13:07.988 --> 01:13:09.033
(Jae-il) Aren’t you hungry?

1673
01:13:09.100 --> 01:13:10.601
You didn't eat anything today

1674
01:13:10.668 --> 01:13:13.401
(Sabi) Don’t tell me anything
I'm so hungry it's hard to walk

1675
01:13:13.468 --> 01:13:14.357
(Jaeil) Really?

1676
01:13:14.836 --> 01:13:15.862
Then do you want to eat this?

1677
01:13:15.929 --> 01:13:17.160
The nurse gave it to me.

1678
01:13:17.901 --> 01:13:18.895
Now

1679
01:13:22.044 --> 01:13:23.435
(Sabi) There are only two?

1680
01:13:23.502 --> 01:13:25.088
The kids probably didn't eat either.

1681
01:13:26.001 --> 01:13:27.003
just us

1682
01:13:29.201 --> 01:13:30.506
Shall we eat and go in?

1683
01:13:31.540 --> 01:13:34.101
Doesn't that seem a bit mean?

1684
01:13:34.168 --> 01:13:35.882
This is very famous

1685
01:13:35.949 --> 01:13:38.662
Sold out every day
They say if you don’t wait, you can’t buy even if you have money.

1686
01:13:39.686 --> 01:13:40.701
Still...

1687
01:13:41.284 --> 01:13:42.122
Did you see it yesterday?

1688
01:13:42.189 --> 01:13:43.635
- Did they fight?
- (Sabi) Yes

1689
01:13:43.702 --> 01:13:45.001
(Jaeil) In times like that, we need to be together.

1690
01:13:45.068 --> 01:13:46.756
We can't reconcile because we're embarrassed

1691
01:13:47.535 --> 01:13:48.501
(Sabi) Ah

1692
01:13:48.568 --> 01:13:50.860
Avoiding this place
It's all for them?

1693
01:13:52.299 --> 01:13:53.162
okay?

1694
01:13:54.402 --> 01:13:55.275
Then

1695
01:13:56.901 --> 01:13:57.867
Is that so?

1696
01:13:59.135 --> 01:14:00.568
Where should we go to eat?

1697
01:14:00.635 --> 01:14:01.634
ah!

1698
01:14:01.701 --> 01:14:02.672
Let's go there and eat.

1699
01:14:03.580 --> 01:14:04.711
Oh, there?

1700
01:14:04.778 --> 01:14:07.343
Yeah, if I go now, no one will be there, right?
let's go

1701
01:14:14.087 --> 01:14:15.790
(Ikjun) It’s been so long since I came here

1702
01:14:15.857 --> 01:14:17.093
Isn't this the way?

1703
01:14:17.160 --> 01:14:18.254
(Songhwa) No, that’s right

1704
01:14:18.769 --> 01:14:20.934
Turn left in front of you and go straight.

1705
01:14:21.001 --> 01:14:23.626
There is an escalator
If you take that down, it's the lobby.

1706
01:14:25.799 --> 01:14:27.763
(Ikjun) Songhwa Why don’t you know anything?

1707
01:14:29.236 --> 01:14:30.601
(Songhwa) It’s written

1708
01:14:30.668 --> 01:14:33.268
(Ikjun) Ah! Oh, I didn't see it.

1709
01:14:33.335 --> 01:14:34.702
Looking at other things, only looking at you

1710
01:14:34.769 --> 01:14:36.810
[Songhwa’s laughter]

1711
01:14:36.877 --> 01:14:38.879
- (Songhwa) Write it, hey, but
- (Ikjun) Yes

1712
01:14:38.946 --> 01:14:41.544
(Songhwa) Because I come to the outpatient clinic at night
It's a little scary

1713
01:14:42.216 --> 01:14:43.379
There's no one

1714
01:14:43.984 --> 01:14:45.245
(Ikjun) No

1715
01:14:45.312 --> 01:14:46.315
who is here

1716
01:14:48.901 --> 01:14:49.852
Who is there?

1717
01:14:54.735 --> 01:14:56.434
Why do you say there is something when no one is there?

1718
01:14:56.501 --> 01:14:58.368
Hey, don't do that.

1719
01:14:58.435 --> 01:14:59.495
It's not scary

1720
01:15:00.502 --> 01:15:03.301
(Ikjun) There are probably cockroaches here?

1721
01:15:03.368 --> 01:15:04.300
cockroach?

1722
01:15:04.868 --> 01:15:06.767
There are some cockroaches in the hospital, no way

1723
01:15:06.834 --> 01:15:08.604
No, not real cockroaches.

1724
01:15:09.602 --> 01:15:11.240
cockroaches in love

1725
01:15:12.813 --> 01:15:13.880
(Songhwa) Um

1726
01:15:13.947 --> 01:15:16.383
(Ikjun) There is no time and nowhere to meet.

1727
01:15:16.450 --> 01:15:18.169
I need to date

1728
01:15:18.236 --> 01:15:19.786
So in the hospital

1729
01:15:19.853 --> 01:15:22.078
You only look for places where there are no people.

1730
01:15:22.602 --> 01:15:24.420
(Songhwa) So where is everyone going?

1731
01:15:25.568 --> 01:15:27.368
Emergency stairs? On-call room?

1732
01:15:27.435 --> 01:15:28.268
kid!

1733
01:15:28.335 --> 01:15:30.635
That's where I go when I want to get caught.

1734
01:15:30.702 --> 01:15:31.834
Then?

1735
01:15:31.901 --> 01:15:32.968
[surprised gasp]

1736
01:15:33.035 --> 01:15:33.963
(Songhwa) Here?

1737
01:15:34.762 --> 01:15:35.641
[Sound of snapping fingers]

1738
01:15:36.270 --> 01:15:37.600
(Ikjun) That’s right

1739
01:15:38.200 --> 01:15:40.934
There are no outpatients at night.
There are no patients and no medical staff.

1740
01:15:41.001 --> 01:15:42.008
(Songhwa) Oh

1741
01:15:42.075 --> 01:15:44.034
(Ikjun) So secretly

1742
01:15:44.101 --> 01:15:45.834
I'm having a date here

1743
01:15:45.901 --> 01:15:48.415
Sometimes professors
I'm coming to retrieve what I left behind.

1744
01:15:48.482 --> 01:15:49.702
[surprised] What should I do?

1745
01:15:49.769 --> 01:15:51.952
- You open the door and turn on the light, right?
- (Songhwa) Oh

1746
01:15:52.019 --> 01:15:53.602
Then something scattered

1747
01:15:53.669 --> 01:15:54.568
like a cockroach

1748
01:15:54.635 --> 01:15:55.867
Where are you all going?

1749
01:15:55.934 --> 01:15:58.468
(Ikjun) Well, it’s stuck on the wall.

1750
01:15:58.535 --> 01:15:59.801
Hiding behind the door like this

1751
01:15:59.868 --> 01:16:01.668
I just went under the desk

1752
01:16:01.735 --> 01:16:03.659
(Songhwa) Ah
[Songhwa’s laughter]

1753
01:16:05.468 --> 01:16:06.495
But you

1754
01:16:07.834 --> 01:16:09.632
How do you know that in such detail?

1755
01:16:12.934 --> 01:16:14.403
Have you been hiding a lot?

1756
01:16:15.976 --> 01:16:17.367
(Ikjun) Oh my...

1757
01:16:17.434 --> 01:16:19.775
[Sound of squeezing disinfectant]
Hey, Junwan

1758
01:16:20.302 --> 01:16:22.034
When Junwan was a major

1759
01:16:22.101 --> 01:16:23.834
He said that often, I heard it too.

1760
01:16:23.901 --> 01:16:25.014
Ah

